                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ34vS6XqrQjQRlNAVCYj_YY8/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkcWQyNVdkVmgwWldKbVh6bG5jWGcxT1dodmNXYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "8 months ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This American brunch spot isn\u0027t very spacious, but it was surprisingly crowded; we had to wait a while to find a seat. The portions are generous, especially the burgers, which were stuffed with lettuce, steak, and various toppings. Each bite was incredibly satisfying, and the fresh lettuce provided a crisp texture, making the burger less greasy.\n\nBesides the burgers, the salad included with the set meal was also amazing. It contained lettuce, cucumber, corn, sausage, mushrooms, and even a slice of apple—a rich and balanced selection that balanced deliciousness and nutrition. Although you might have to wait during peak hours, once the food arrived, it was all worth it.\n\nOverall, this is a great value brunch spot, perfect for those who want a hearty and affordable meal. While the dining environment is simple, the quality and portion sizes are excellent. If you don\u0027t mind waiting a little longer for a great value brunch, this is definitely a good choice.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "這家美式早午餐店的店內空間不大，人潮卻相當多，我們等了一會兒才找到位子。這裡的餐點份量十足，特別是漢堡，裡頭塞滿了生菜、肉排和各種配料，一口咬下非常滿足，新鮮的生菜提供了清脆的口感，讓漢堡吃起來不那麼油膩。\n​除了漢堡，套餐附贈的沙拉也讓人驚艷，裡頭有生菜、小黃瓜、玉米、香腸、菇類，甚至還有一片蘋果，用料豐富又均衡，兼顧了美味和營養。雖然用餐尖峰時間需要耐心等待，但餐點上桌後，會覺得一切都是值得的。\n​總體而言，這是一家CP值很高的早午餐店，適合想吃得豐盛又划算的人。雖然用餐環境比較簡樸，但餐點的品質和份量都表現出色。如果你不介意花點時間排隊，想來份物超所值的早午餐，這裡絕對是個好選擇。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
